{"id":"so-not-to","lv":"b2","n":25,"cat":"discourse","t":"I think so, I hope not, I don't think…: tránh lặp lại","en":"I think so. · I hope not. · I'd love to. · I don't think…","reg":"spoken","sum":"Tránh lặp lại khi đáp lời. So thay cho cả mệnh đề khẳng định sau think, hope, guess, suppose, be afraid: Will it rain? — I think so / I hope not / I'm afraid so / I'm afraid not (không nói I think it / I hope no). To thay cho cả cụm động từ: Would you like to come? — I'd love to. I didn't want to. Chuyển phủ định lên động từ chính: I don't think it will rain (tự nhiên hơn I think it won't rain); tương tự I don't believe…, I don't expect… — nhưng hope thì không chuyển (I hope it won't rain).","forms":[{"f":"I think so · I hope not · I'm afraid not","vi":"Will it rain? — I hope not."},{"f":"I'd love to · I didn't want to (giữ to, bỏ động từ)","vi":"Can you come? — I'd love to."},{"f":"I don't think + khẳng định (chuyển phủ định)","vi":"I don't think it will rain."},{"f":"hope không chuyển phủ định","vi":"I hope it won't rain."}],"pts":[{"id":"so-not-substitution","name":"so / not substitution","vi":"I think so / I hope not / I'm afraid not"},{"id":"to-ellipsis","name":"Ellipsis after to","vi":"I'd love to. / I didn't want to."},{"id":"transferred-negation","name":"Transferred negation","vi":"I don't think it will… (tự nhiên hơn I think it won't)"}],"cast":{"leo":{"name":{"en":"Leo","vi":"Leo"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"tee","top":"#3E8E7E","topShade":"#32766A","collar":"#32766A","accent":"#2F7D6D","hairColor":"#3B2A20"},"x":560},"nam":{"name":{"en":"Nam","vi":"Nam"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"shirt","top":"#4F7CC4","topShade":"#3F68A8","accent":"#3F68A8","hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#EFC9A4","skinShade":"#DDB08A"},"x":1040}},"bg":"park","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Are we still having the barbecue on Saturday?","vi":"Thứ bảy mình vẫn tổ chức tiệc nướng chứ?","ipa":["ɑɹ","wi","stɪl","ˈhævɪŋ","ðə","ˈbɑɹbɪˌkju","ɑn","ˈsætɚdi"],"who":"leo","ann":{"expression":"thinking"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":2.386,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,0.514],[2,0.614],[3,0.838],[4,1.139],[5,1.226],[6,1.689],[7,1.801]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"I think so. Will it rain?","vi":"Tôi nghĩ là có. Trời có mưa không nhỉ?","ipa":["aɪ","θɪŋk","soʊ","wɪl","ɪt","ɹeɪn"],"who":"nam","ann":{"expression":"thinking"},"b":1,"start":3.176,"end":4.886,"timing":[[0,3.176],[1,3.186],[2,3.399],[3,4.161],[4,4.299],[5,4.461]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"I hope not! I don't think it will. The forecast looks good.","vi":"Mong là không! Tôi nghĩ là trời sẽ không mưa đâu. Dự báo trông ổn lắm.","ipa":["aɪ","hoʊp","nɑt","aɪ","doʊnt","θɪŋk","ɪt","wɪl","ðə","ˈfɔɹˌkæst","lʊks","ɡʊd"],"who":"leo","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":5.676,"end":8.796,"timing":[[0,5.676],[1,5.701],[2,5.863],[3,6.588],[4,6.651],[5,6.814],[6,6.976],[7,7.088],[8,7.751],[9,7.814],[10,8.314],[11,8.501]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Great. Would you like to invite Mia?","vi":"Tuyệt. Cậu có muốn mời Mia không?","ipa":["ɡɹeɪt","wʊd","ju","laɪk","tu","ˌɪnˈvaɪt","ˈmiə"],"who":"nam","ann":{"expression":"happy"},"b":1,"start":9.586,"end":11.756,"timing":[[0,9.586],[1,10.269],[2,10.394],[3,10.519],[4,10.769],[5,10.931],[6,11.356]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"I'd love to, but I'm afraid she's busy.","vi":"Tớ rất muốn, nhưng e là cô ấy bận.","ipa":["aɪd","lʌv","tu","bʌt","aɪm","əˈfɹeɪd","ʃiz","ˈbɪzi"],"who":"leo","ann":{"expression":"sad"},"b":1,"start":12.546,"end":14.866,"timing":[[0,12.546],[1,12.671],[2,12.946],[3,13.509],[4,13.646],[5,13.759],[6,14.159],[7,14.421]]},{"k":"n","sec":"hook","parts":[{"e":"I think so"},{"v":", "},{"e":"I hope not"},{"v":": chữ "},{"e":"so"},{"v":" và "},{"e":"not"},{"v":" thay cho cả một mệnh đề, nên không phải lặp lại câu hỏi. "},{"e":"I'd love to"},{"v":": giữ lại "},{"e":"to"},{"v":", bỏ động từ. Còn "},{"e":"I don't think it will"},{"v":": người Anh chuyển chữ "},{"e":"not"},{"v":" lên "},{"e":"think"},{"v":"."}],"b":1,"start":15.506,"end":32.0